{"title":"Career Roadmap · Entrepreneur / Founder","role":"Entrepreneur / Founder","summary":"An Entrepreneur / Founder identifies a market opportunity, develops a business model, builds a product or service, acquires customers, manages finances and operations, builds teams, and takes responsibility for the overall direction of the venture.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BBA – Entrepreneurship / Family Business is a highly relevant foundation because it exposes students to entrepreneurship, business strategy, marketing, finance, operations, leadership, innovation, and family-business management."},{"type":"p","text":"However, entrepreneurship is different from most careers: there is no fixed qualification-to-job pathway. A BBA can provide business knowledge, but the strongest evidence of entrepreneurial capability is the ability to identify a problem, validate it, build a solution, acquire customers, manage cash, and create sustainable business value."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Entrepreneurial Foundation"},{"text":"BBA + startup projects + market validation + internships"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Venture Building"},{"text":"Founder, Co-founder, Business Owner, Startup Operator"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Scale & Management"},{"text":"Founder/CEO, Business Head, Venture Builder"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Enterprise & Investment"},{"text":"Founder/CEO, Group Entrepreneur, Investor, Advisor"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BBA Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Entrepreneurial Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of management"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Organisational behaviour"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop Entrepreneurial Habits"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identify customer problems"},{"text":"Observe market gaps"},{"text":"Research industries"},{"text":"Analyse competitors"},{"text":"Interview potential customers"},{"text":"Evaluate business ideas"},{"text":"Estimate market size"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"I have a business idea.\""},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"I have evidence that customers have this problem and may pay for a solution.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Business Model & Market Validation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Market Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Customer personas"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"TAM/SAM/SOM"},{"text":"Customer interviews"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Demand validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Models"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B2B"},{"text":"B2C"},{"text":"B2B2C"},{"text":"Marketplace"},{"text":"Subscription"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"D2C"},{"text":"Franchise"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Commission-based models"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Model Canvas"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Channels"},{"text":"Customer relationships"},{"text":"Revenue streams"},{"text":"Key resources"},{"text":"Key activities"},{"text":"Key partners"},{"text":"Cost structure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Finance for Entrepreneurs"},{"type":"p","text":"A founder needs strong financial understanding."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"P&L"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Accounts receivable"},{"text":"Accounts payable"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Startup Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Burn rate"},{"text":"Runway"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Contribution margin"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Break-even"},{"text":"Unit economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Funding"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bootstrapping"},{"text":"Friends & family"},{"text":"Angel investment"},{"text":"Venture capital"},{"text":"Debt financing"},{"text":"Grants"},{"text":"Incubators"},{"text":"Accelerators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity dilution"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Cap tables"},{"text":"Term sheets"},{"text":"Investor due diligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Product & Customer Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical capability in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MVP development"},{"text":"Product-market fit"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"User feedback"},{"text":"Product iteration"},{"text":"UX fundamentals"},{"text":"Product roadmap"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Acquisition"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Paid advertising"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Partnerships"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prospecting"},{"text":"Customer discovery"},{"text":"Pitching"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Closing"},{"text":"B2B sales"},{"text":"Account management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A founder should understand both:"},{"type":"h","text":"How to build the product"},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"p","text":"How to sell the product."},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year — Build a Real Venture"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of relying only on theoretical entrepreneurship projects, attempt to build a small real business."},{"type":"h","text":"Suggested Process"},{"type":"h","text":"Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Interviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Market Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Model"},{"type":"h","text":"MVP"},{"type":"h","text":"First Users"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Feedback"},{"type":"h","text":"Iteration"},{"type":"h","text":"First Revenue"},{"type":"h","text":"Unit Economics"},{"type":"h","text":"Growth"},{"type":"p","text":"Even a small venture that generates genuine customer feedback and revenue can provide more entrepreneurial learning than a purely theoretical business plan."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Startup Validation Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify a problem and conduct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"20–50 customer interviews"},{"text":"Competitor research"},{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Pricing research"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then determine whether the problem is sufficiently important to solve."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Business Model Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete Business Model Canvas and financial model."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"Product"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Partners"},{"text":"Competitive advantage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. MVP Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a basic product or service."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the idea:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Website"},{"text":"Mobile app"},{"text":"SaaS prototype"},{"text":"Marketplace"},{"text":"Service business"},{"text":"Physical product prototype"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The MVP should test the core value proposition, not attempt to build everything."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Startup Financial Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue forecast"},{"text":"Expense forecast"},{"text":"P&L"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Break-even analysis"},{"text":"Unit economics"},{"text":"Funding requirement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Go-to-Market Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Target Customer","Positioning","Pricing","Distribution","Marketing","Sales","Retention"]},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"LTV"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Family Business Pathway"},{"type":"p","text":"For students joining an existing family business, the roadmap is somewhat different."},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 1 — Understand the Existing Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Suppliers"},{"text":"Employees"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Profitability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 2 — Digitise"},{"type":"p","text":"Introduce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting software"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Inventory management"},{"text":"Online presence"},{"text":"Digital marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 3 — Improve Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Supplier performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 4 — Expand"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"New products"},{"text":"New markets"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Geographic expansion"},{"text":"Partnerships"},{"text":"Franchising"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 5 — Professionalise Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial controls"},{"text":"Management reporting"},{"text":"Business succession planning"},{"text":"Governance structures"},{"text":"Professional management"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An entrepreneurship student should not limit internships to \"entrepreneurship internships.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Useful experiences include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Startup"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Startup Operations Intern"},{"text":"Founder’s Office Intern"},{"text":"Business Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Business Development Intern"},{"text":"Growth Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Management Intern"},{"text":"Product Operations Intern"},{"text":"Product Marketing Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance Intern"},{"text":"FP&A Intern"},{"text":"Investment Analyst Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales & Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales Intern"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Family Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Working directly inside a family business can also be highly valuable if the student takes responsibility for measurable business improvements."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Entrepreneurship does not necessarily mean immediately founding a company."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful early-career roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Founder / Co-founder"},{"text":"Startup Operator"},{"text":"Founder’s Office Associate"},{"text":"Business Development Executive"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Strategy Associate"},{"text":"Product Associate"},{"text":"Growth Associate"},{"text":"Operations Associate"},{"text":"Sales Executive"},{"text":"Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Startup Finance Associate"},{"text":"Venture Builder"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These roles provide exposure to how businesses are built before launching a venture independently."},{"type":"h","text":"Entrepreneurial Specialisations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Technology Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"AI"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"HealthTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Developer tools"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful skills:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Technology","Business","Growth"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"2. D2C Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer products"},{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Performance marketing"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Customer retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. B2B Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enterprise problems"},{"text":"Solution selling"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Long sales cycles"},{"text":"Account management"},{"text":"Partnerships"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Social Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social problems"},{"text":"Sustainable business models"},{"text":"Impact measurement"},{"text":"Community development"},{"text":"Inclusive businesses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Family Business Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business transformation"},{"text":"Professionalisation"},{"text":"Digitalisation"},{"text":"Succession"},{"text":"New-market expansion"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Entrepreneurial Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"A founder should understand numbers deeply."},{"type":"h","text":"Growth"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue growth"},{"text":"Customer growth"},{"text":"Market share"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Conversion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Contribution margin"},{"text":"Burn rate"},{"text":"Runway"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"Cash flow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Order fulfilment"},{"text":"Customer support metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern founder does not necessarily need to be a programmer, but should understand technology enough to make good decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Notion/project-management tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Google Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Marketing automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma basics"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"No-code/low-code tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how AI can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Customer support"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Operations automation"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Entrepreneurship is less certification-driven than regulated professions."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Business analytics"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Startup finance"},{"text":"Venture capital fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The priority should be building and validating businesses, rather than collecting certificates."}]},{"heading":"PG Study Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not required to become an entrepreneur."},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Family Business"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other Options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"MSc Innovation Management"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Master of Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For family-business students, an MBA in Family Business, Entrepreneurship, Strategy, or General Management can be useful, particularly after gaining practical operating experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Incubators & Startup Ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Students should actively explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"College incubators"},{"text":"Startup incubators"},{"text":"Accelerators"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship cells"},{"text":"Startup competitions"},{"text":"Government startup programs"},{"text":"Angel networks"},{"text":"Founder communities"},{"text":"Industry mentors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to gain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Mentorship","Customer Access","Network","Capital Knowledge","Execution Experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Era Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"AI significantly lowers the cost of experimenting with new businesses."},{"type":"p","text":"A founder can use AI for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Industry research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Content"},{"text":"Customer support"},{"text":"Product documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content generation"},{"text":"Campaign ideas"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"SEO assistance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workflow automation"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Internal knowledge systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, AI should not replace customer validation, financial discipline, product quality, or human decision-making."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"There is no fixed corporate ladder for entrepreneurs, but a common development pattern is:"},{"type":"h","text":"BBA Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"h","text":"Startup Internship / Founder’s Office"},{"type":"h","text":"Startup Operator / Early Employee"},{"type":"h","text":"Co-founder / Founder"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-Market Fit"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Growth"},{"type":"h","text":"Team & Process Scaling"},{"type":"h","text":"Founder/CEO"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-business Entrepreneur / Investor / Advisor"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Model","Market Research","Competitive Strategy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Cash Flow","Financial Modelling","Unit Economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer Discovery","B2B/B2C Sales","Negotiation","Closing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Marketing","Branding","Growth","Customer Acquisition"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"flow","items":["MVP","Product Management","Customer Feedback"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"flow","items":["Process Management","Hiring","Vendor Management","Scaling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Analytics","CRM","Automation","AI Tools"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"flow","items":["Communication","Decision-Making","Team Building","Networking"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals + problem identification"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Market research + business models + finance"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"MVP + sales + marketing + startup internship"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Launch/validate a real venture"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Startup operator / founder / business development"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Product-market fit + team building + growth"}],[{"text":"5–10 Years"},{"text":"Scale business + management systems"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Founder/CEO / serial entrepreneur / investor"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree-to-career combination, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Entrepreneurship/Family Business","Startup/Founder’s Office Experience","Build or Operate a Venture","Validate Product-Market Fit","Achieve Sustainable Growth","Founder/CEO"]},{"type":"p","text":"The most important distinction is that entrepreneurship is an execution-based career rather than a qualification-based career. A BBA provides useful business fundamentals, but the student should build evidence through customer interviews, MVPs, sales, revenue, financial modelling, business experiments, and operational execution. For family-business students, the strongest approach is to combine traditional business knowledge with digital transformation, analytics, professional governance, e-commerce, and new-market expansion rather than simply inheriting existing responsibilities."}]}]}